content_list.content:
A continuación se presenta el código completo de un sitio web de arquitectura de lujo basado en la teoría arquitectónica mediterránea y los principios de la percepción humana (Leyes de la Gestalt y proporción áurea). Implementa GSAP con ScrollTrigger, pinning, scrubbing y timelines complejos para una experiencia de alto nivel técnico y estético.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ESTUDIO TECTÓNICA | Arquitectura de Autor en Barcelona</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- GSAP Core & Plugins -->
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/CustomEase.min.js"></script>

    <style>
        :root {
            --color-travertino: #E8E3D9;
            --color-hormigon: #2C2C2C;
            --color-acento: #8B4513;
            --color-luz: #F5F1E8;
            --color-sombra: #1A1A1A;
            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            --font-sans: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            --phi: 1.618033988749895;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--color-travertino);
            color: var(--color-hormigon);
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            cursor: none;
        }

        /* Custom Cursor (Perception Principle: Feedback) */
        .cursor {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            background: var(--color-acento);
            border-radius: 50%;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 9999;
            mix-blend-mode: difference;
        }

        .cursor-follower {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border: 1px solid var(--color-hormigon);
            border-radius: 50%;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 9998;
            transition: transform 0.1s ease-out;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 2rem 4rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 100;
            mix-blend-mode: difference;
            color: white;
        }

        .logo {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 3rem;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            position: relative;
            padding-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .nav-links a::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 0;
            height: 1px;
            background: white;
            transition: width 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1);
        }

        .nav-links a:hover::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* Hero Section - Golden Ratio Proportion */
        .hero {
            height: 100vh;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 4rem;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero-content {
            width: 61.8%; /* Golden Ratio */
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            opacity: 0;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
            font-weight: 300;
            line-height: 0.9;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .hero-title span {
            display: block;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero-title span span {
            display: block;
            transform: translateY(100%);
        }

        .hero-description {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            max-width: 400px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            opacity: 0;
        }

        /* Golden Spiral SVG */
        .golden-spiral {
            position: absolute;
            right: 0;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            width: 50vw;
            height: 80vh;
            z-index: 1;
            opacity: 0.3;
        }

        .golden-spiral path {
            fill: none;
            stroke: var(--color-acento);
            stroke-width: 1;
            stroke-dasharray: 2000;
            stroke-dashoffset: 2000;
        }

        /* Horizontal Scroll Projects */
        .projects-section {
            height: 400vh;
            position: relative;
        }

        .projects-container {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .projects-track {
            display: flex;
            gap: 4rem;
            padding: 0 4rem;
        }

        .project-card {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            width: 60vw;
            height: 70vh;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: var(--color-luz);
        }

        .project-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4c5b0 0%, #a89880 100%);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .project-image::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 30%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 50%, transparent 70%);
            animation: shimmer 3s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes shimmer {
            0% { transform: translateX(-100%); }
            100% { transform: translateX(100%); }
        }

        .project-info {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            padding: 3rem;
            background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.8), transparent);
            color: white;
            transform: translateY(100%);
            transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1);
        }

        .project-card:hover .project-info {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .project-title {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .project-location {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        /* Theory Section - Gestalt Principles */
        .theory-section {
            padding: 10rem 4rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        .theory-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 4rem;
            margin-top: 4rem;
        }

        .theory-item {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(50px);
        }

        .theory-number {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: 5rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            color: var(--color-acento);
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .theory-title {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .theory-text {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* Parallax Section */
        .parallax-section {
            height: 100vh;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .parallax-bg {
            position: absolute;
            width: 120%;
            height: 120%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B4513 0%, #654321 100%);
            top: -10%;
            left: -10%;
        }

        .parallax-text {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 10rem);
            font-weight: 300;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            mix-blend-mode: overlay;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: var(--color-hormigon);
            color: white;
            padding: 8rem 4rem 4rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        .footer-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .footer-title {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .footer-column h4 {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        .footer-column ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .footer-column li {
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        .footer-column a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
        }

        .footer-column a:hover {
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            padding-top: 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            opacity: 0.5;
        }

        /* Scroll Progress Indicator */
        .scroll-progress {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 2px;
            background: transparent;
            z-index: 9999;
        }

        .scroll-progress-bar {
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--color-acento);
            width: 0%;
            transform-origin: left;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-content { width: 100%; }
            .theory-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .footer-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            nav { padding: 1.5rem 2rem; }
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .hero { padding: 0 2rem; }
            .projects-track { padding: 0 2rem; }
            .project-card { width: 85vw; }
            .theory-section { padding: 6rem 2rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Custom Cursor -->
    <div class="cursor"></div>
    <div class="cursor-follower"></div>

    <!-- Scroll Progress -->
    <div class="scroll-progress">
        <div class="scroll-progress-bar"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav>
        <div class="logo">TECTÓNICA</div>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#filosofia">Filosofía</a></li>
            <li><a href="#proyectos">Proyectos</a></li>
            <li><a href="#teoria">Teoría</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contacto">Contacto</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-subtitle">Estudio de Arquitectura · Barcelona</div>
            <h1 class="hero-title">
                <span><span>La materia</span></span>
                <span><span>dialoga con</span></span>
                <span><span>la luz.</span></span>
            </h1>
            <p class="hero-description">
                Arquitectura de autor basada en el racionalismo mediterráneo, la proporción áurea y la percepción humana del espacio habitable.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Golden Spiral -->
        <svg class="golden-spiral" viewBox="0 0 400 400">
            <path d="M200,200 Q200,100 300,100 Q400,100 400,200 Q400,350 250,350 Q50,350 50,200 Q50,0 350,0"/>
            <path d="M200,200 Q200,150 250,150 Q300,150 300,200 Q300,275 225,275 Q125,275 125,200 Q125,75 325,75"/>
        </svg>
    </section>

    <!-- Projects Horizontal Scroll -->
    <section class="projects-section">
        <div class="projects-container">
            <div class="projects-track">
                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-image"></div>
                    <div class="project-info">
                        <h3 class="project-title">Casa Travertino</h3>
                        <p class="project-location">Pedralbes, Barcelona</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-image"></div>
                    <div class="project-info">
                        <h3 class="project-title">Loft Eixample</h3>
                        <p class="project-location">Eixample, Barcelona</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-image"></div>
                    <div class="project-info">
                        <h3 class="project-title">Villa Mediterránea</h3>
                        <p class="project-location">Costa Brava, Girona</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-image"></div>
                    <div class="project-info">
                        <h3 class="project-title">Ático Paseo de Gracia</h3>
                        <p class="project-location">Paseo de Gracia, Barcelona</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Theory Section -->
    <section class="theory-section" id="teoria">
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Principios de Percepción</h2>
        <p style="max-width: 600px; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8; font-weight: 300;">
            Nuestra práctica se fundamenta en las leyes de la Gestalt y la psicología de la percepción espacial, aplicadas a la experiencia arquitectónica.
        </p>

        <div class="theory-grid">
